1
00:00:00,315 --> 00:00:04,315
(Sheldon:)Of course I do. The essence of the custom
is that I now have to go and purchase...

2
00:00:04,486 --> 00:00:08,196
(Sheldon:)...a gift of commensurate value and
representing the same level of friendship...

3
00:00:08,365 --> 00:00:11,365
(Sheldon:)...as that represented by the gift
you've given me.

4
00:00:11,535 --> 00:00:14,705
(Sheldon:)It's no wonder suicide rates skyrocket
this time of year.

5
00:00:15,622 --> 00:00:17,702
Okay, forget it,
I'm not giving you a present.

6
00:00:17,874 --> 00:00:20,834
(Sheldon:)No, it's too late. I see it.
That elf sticker says "To Sheldon."

7
00:00:22,587 --> 00:00:24,837
(Sheldon:)The die has been cast.
The moving finger has writ.

8
00:00:25,006 --> 00:00:26,886
(Sheldon:)Hannibal has crossed the Alps.

9
00:00:28,844 --> 00:00:32,224
(Howard(to Raj who is whispering in his ear):)I know. It's funny
when it's not happening to us.

10
00:00:34,057 --> 00:00:38,517
- Sheldon, I am very, very sorry.
- No, no. I brought this on myself...

11
00:00:38,687 --> 00:00:42,107
(Sheldon:)...by being such an endearing
and important part of your life.

12
00:00:43,483 --> 00:00:45,693
(Sheldon:)I'm going to need a ride to the mall.

13
00:00:46,736 --> 00:00:49,026
(Howard:)It's happening to us.

14
00:00:50,532 --> 00:00:53,492
LEONARD:
Ow. Ow.

15
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:56,200
DAVID: Are you gonna make it?
- Yeah, I guess.

16
00:00:58,039 --> 00:01:01,019
(Leonard:)Thanks for letting me try out
your motorcycle.

